// Sable on the steppe (character-bibles.md §2, Act 2; world-map.md §6): she rows Wren north from the quay (<<row>>,
// `Boat`) and the boat lands in the Dry River, among the Ferrymen's old hulls on their sides (environment.md, River_2),
// where the clan sleeps now. She reads the names on the bows and counts the boats that never came back: the first
// time in the game she counts who did not come back, aloud. She stands by the boat while it is here (FlagPresence on
// `sable.boat_at`), and rows Wren home when asked.

title: River_Sable
---
<<if not has_flag("sable.hulls_counted")>>
    Sable: Mouth's silted. We walked the boat the last mile. Don't tell the Ferrymen. #face:bright #line:0d0d88a
    Sable: Those are ours. Were. Ferrymen rowed this river when it had a river in it. #face:grave #line:0e93023
    Sable: Names on the bows. Gannet. Little Tern. The Patience. One. Two. Three. #face:grave #line:08c2b1c
    Sable: Eleven out, none back. I stopped counting who came back. Turns out I only stopped aloud. #face:grave #line:03a7e5c
    <<flag sable.hulls_counted 1>>
    -> Count them with me. #line:07841dc
        <<voice warden windreach>>
        Sable: Eleven. Twelve, with mine. Mine goes home. That's the whole difference, and it's enough. #face:bright #line:08ac063
    -> Whose was the blue one? #line:083e8c5
        <<voice surveyor windreach>>
        Sable: My father's. I'd sell you the other ten. Not that one. #face:wary #line:0e9273e
    -> ... #line:036f552
        <<voice drift windreach>>
        Sable: Aye. The steppe-folk sleep in them now. Good. Somebody should. #face:bright #line:0f75047
    Sable: Boat's at the bank. I'll wait with it. Not long. Long enough. #line:01f0bd9
    <<stop>>
<<endif>>
Sable: Eleven still. Nobody's moved them. Nobody's going to. #still #face:grave #line:0667fe5
-> Row me back to the quay. #line:0284ad8
    <<voice surveyor windreach>>
    Sable: Tide's ours. Get in. #line:0babbd4
    <<row quay>>
-> Not yet. #line:04b87b0
    <<voice drift windreach>>
    Sable: Then I'll count them again. Passes the time. Costs nothing. #still #face:grave #line:0040438
===
